Third-party code

Many scripts in this repository are ports of, or contain code from, scripts by
other authors. Such code keeps the license of its original author; the MIT
license above covers only the parts written for this repository. In particular,
files whose header states another license are under that license, for example:

- dfttest2.py: GPL-3.0 (AmusementClub/vs-dfttest2)
- resamplehq.py: GPL-3.0 (4re/resamplehq)
- FrameRateConverter.py: GPL-2.0-or-later (mysteryx93/FrameRateConverter)
- descale.py, rekt.py: MIT (Irrational-Encoding-Wizardry/descale, OpusGang/rekt)
- vs_colorfix.py, vs_temporalfix_*.py: Apache-2.0 (pifroggi)
- vs_undistort_mlrt.py: GPL-2.0 (pifroggi/vs_undistort)
